Area "1" -- "0..*" Project : assigned to

Team "1" -- "1" SeniorResearcher : led by
Team "1" -- "1..*" JuniorResearcher : includes
Team "1" -- "1" Project : carries out

ProjectActivation "1" -- "1" Project : involves
ProjectActivation "1" -- "1" Area : involves
ProjectActivation "1" -- "1" Team : involves
ProjectActivation "1" -- "1" SeniorResearcher : involves

Researcher extends SeniorResearcher
Researcher extends JuniorResearcher

@enduml

